  "body": "Sprouted from #12311.\r\n\r\nOnce Mypy supports Concatenate, it could be written as\r\n```python\r\n     def _do_execute(\r\n         self,\r\n         func: Callable[Concatenate[str, P], R],\r\n         sql: str,\r\n         *args: P.args,\r\n         **kwargs: P.kwargs,\r\n     ) -> R:\r\n```\r\nso long as we also pass kwargs.",
